WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.015 --> 00:00:02.520
File scans in notes

2
00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:06.387
Open Import scanned pages from the scan icon in the ribbon

3
00:00:06.387 --> 00:00:10.254
Drop photos of printed worksheets here, or click to choose

4
00:00:10.254 --> 00:00:14.255
The QR code sends it to its unit operation block, named here

5
00:00:14.255 --> 00:00:16.354
Undo takes it out again

6
00:00:16.354 --> 00:00:23.604
Open note shows where it went

7
00:00:23.604 --> 00:00:27.671
A thumbnail goes under Worksheet scans at the end of the step

8
00:00:27.671 --> 00:00:32.744
Open full size shows it at its original size
